{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1831"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge society/business","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/society__business.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",946],["+","Even the bumblebee has its brand. Hummel, the German word for bumblebee, was founded in Hamburg in 1923 and took the insect as its emblem. The company later moved to Denmark and is now based in Aarhus; its bumblebee logo and chevrons are familiar above all from the shirts of handball and football clubs.\n\n"],["=",97],["+","\n| Hummel | bumblebee | 1923 |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",902],["+","Sogar die Hummel hat ihre Marke. Hummel wurde 1923 in Hamburg gegründet und wählte das Insekt zu seinem Wappentier. Später zog das Unternehmen nach Dänemark und hat heute seinen Sitz in Aarhus; das Hummel-Logo und die Winkel auf den Ärmeln kennt man vor allem von den Trikots von Handball- und Fußballklubs.\n\n"],["=",97],["+","\n| Hummel | Hummel | 1923 |"]]}]},
